#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-AD0654 expect=violation domain=ADAE
# Rule:Description: Raise an error when SRCSEQ is present in an ADVERSE EVENT sub-class OCCDS dataset (e.g., ADAE); SRCSEQ must not be used for the AE sub-class (AESEQ replaces SRCDOM+SRCSEQ per OCCDS v1.1).
#expectViolationCount 1
#expectViolationAt SRCSEQ=-
dataset ADAE
col SRCSEQ type=Char
col AETERM type=Char
---
- | HEADACHE
---
